    "detailed_description": "A wicked curse has taken over the land, corrupting all life and commanding it as its own. Construct towers, arm your Hero and design a combination of defenses capable of holding back the tide in this Action Tower Defense game. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624060/extras/descgif1.GIF?t=1751298390\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Towers</h2>Combine up to 10 different Towers on the battlefield to drive the enemy back, with multiple options for defense, offense, economy. Upgrade these towers to further specialize them, or to improve their versatility.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624060/extras/descgif2.GIF?t=1751298390\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero Weapons</h2>Choose 2 from a total of 9 weapons to fight directly with your Hero, with each having their own fighting style. Fight from a distance, up close and personal, focus on dealing damage or providing defense and utility for your allies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624060/extras/descgif3.GIF?t=1751298390\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Game Mode</h2>Experience the traditional Tower Defense gameplay in the Classic gamemode, defeating increasingly powerful enemy waves while making sure you do not run out of lives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624060/extras/descgif4.GIF?t=1751298390\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Breakthrough Game Mode</h2>Fight through a gruesome tug-of-war in the Breakthrough gamemode, gaining more and more territory as you and your allies push back the enemy, until you finally reach and destroy the enemy base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624060/extras/descgif5.GIF?t=1751298390\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero Customization</h2>Further customize your playstyle by selecting from 4 actives and 8 passives to bring to the battlefield to improve your Hero in different ways, from mobility to combat stats to improving nearby towers, choose the skills that best complement your strategy.",
